    merge - lorax contact, WeightIt/MatchIt contact, tmle contact, GitHub issue #80,
    CRAN submission. Between the merge and the submission, the
    host-neutral engine arc (VD 2026-09-23) and the factor
    split-probability research (VD 2026-09-28, factor encoding below),
    then the freeze.
  bump the DESCRIPTION Date at the RC.
  contact lorax's maintainer before the CRAN submission: its example
    and tests fit bart() with a three-level factor response, which
    0.9-x silently coded as 0/1/2 and 1.0-0 refuses (VD 2026-09-08:
    let it break, ask for the example to change; docs/decisions.md
    dec-B74). insight's dbarts test fit NA responses, which dec-A70 broke
    and dec-B108 answered: na.action defaults to na.keepPredictors, which
    drops missing-response rows, so re-check the break before the
